{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a6ebf3a6a9d9c8e39ed519033062db52b440abd3171e72e20fa850d70f352ba4","ja":"さらなる高みへ飛ぶために！","zh":"为了飞向更高的境界！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"52a9fe1b5468171ab227c7ed87cfe918fa79f7c1c326cf4adb69fe1eb3b63feb","ja":"まだ拍手が鳴りやまないわ……！\nミッションコンプリートね！　にひひっ♪","zh":"掌声还没停呢……！\n任务完成了呢！　嘻嘻♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"84c1ca64f25c1e02e5b3785190ebe1c3a3057c418f5e03a74371508d415b9b6a","ja":"桃子たちのステージだもん、当然だよ！\nみんな、夢中になってくれたみたいだね♪","zh":"是桃子她们的舞台嘛，当然啦！\n看来大家都看得入迷了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4754208a6ee79bdf4e48481fdc7887dda0139c8faa19d093d271e6cfd72670d5","ja":"次は劇場でも、みんなと一緒に\nまたお芝居したいな～って思ったよ！","zh":"下次在剧场也想和大家一起\n再演戏呢～我心想！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0fc259d405151d832b13b8d66485c42569f2d908f39edcce95a608475a43c1ed","ja":"もう次の話なんて……欲張りなんだから。\nでもま、それでこそ怪盗シャインナイトね。","zh":"都已经在说下一个了……真是贪心。\n不过，这才像怪盗シャインナイト嘛。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cfe6ada5c7af1685faaa1d5fd2b1cea6d7a5880fcf0fc8321b302890fca595fc","ja":"次はさらにパワーアップした私たちを見せて\nあげなくちゃ！　相手の想像の上をいかないとね♪","zh":"下次得让你们见识到更加强大的我们！不超越对手的想象可不行呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"888e59d5cbecf3d46d3f19dd02cc28368545035ef1725b9d1e292a2db1e79c6f","ja":"想像の上ですか～。今の私たちはうさぎさん、\nジャンプは大の得意ですからね～♪","zh":"是不是超乎想像呢～。现在的我们是兔子，\n跳跃可是最擅长的哦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"dc28febed7e8486d30a2155be5b11455ba3fe5f5fe78e5b0eb9af54541d096b0","ja":"ステージを所狭しとぴょんぴょん跳ねて、\n観客のみなさんを驚かせますよ～。ふふふ♪","zh":"在舞台上到处蹦蹦跳跳，\n让观众们大吃一惊哦～。呵呵呵♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e32f44418ef83967725c770e13b4a97e8a266b335f73fae5bbec76dbceac2d7d","ja":"かなり直接的なジャンプね……。でも、\nワイヤーアクションは派手だし、アリかも……？","zh":"挺直接的跳跃呢……。不过，\n威亚动作很华丽，也许可行……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"850d36a6560f5ad84dc924967d2e88748fb99d5996d949cc14ffc823c39ac615","ja":"ふふっ、次も楽しくなりそう♪　じゃあ大きな\nジャンプのため、今はたっぷり力をつけましょう！","zh":"呵呵，下次看起来也会很有趣呢♪　那么为了\n来个大跳跃，现在先好好积蓄力量吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_941.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"7aca34e8dd74b28925dd5ad762da0c23394266106760eb56e7699ae776e51993","ja":"はい～♪　では今夜の打ち上げはにんじん……\nではなく、お肉にしておきましょう～♪","zh":"好～♪　那么今晚的庆功宴就吃胡萝卜……\n不对，还是吃肉吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
